entries.content:
The N Corp. Inquisition is a subdivision of Nagel und Hammer. It consists of employees brainwashed to become cultists with Canned Experience to implement inhumane extremist beliefs of the "purity" of human flesh, turning them into insane, crusader-like zealots bearing an immense hatred for those with robotic prosthetics. With anti-prosthetic purification in their minds, their prejudice boils to the point of gleefully murdering or torturing cyborgs and even exhuming and desecrating cybernetic corpses just to nail them to the ground or walls.

This subdivision is run under a ranked hierarchy:

The One who Grips: the highest ranking among the group, and their cult leader. Gives orders to other Inquisitors, who follow them unconditionally with religious zeal;
The One Who Shall Grip: The Second highest rank among the group, and important to The One who Grips;
The Großhammer: the second-in-command inquisitor, personally ordered by The One who Grips themselves to deliver justice upon those they deemed heretics;
Mittelhammers: the third-in-command inquisitor;
Kleinhammers: the second lowest pawn for an inquisitor.
